   ],
   "note": "One bar of copper with 4 holes, all one net: push a pin header or a lead through any hole, or solder a wire or an SMD part flat on the bar (through-hole and deadbug in one, whatever the 'Pads of this part' choice). Not in the parts list (BOM). The bar starts 0.3 mm past the pad of the module in front of it, so the module's pad and the bar are touching copper: no wire needed between them."
  },
